# WORK-LAB 最终前向收敛执行任务包

> 文件定位：把 WORK-LAB 的历史对话、旧任务包、旧蓝图、云端现状、未完成项和用户最新决策压缩成一个可执行 successor。  
> 本文件不是新的产品蓝图，不恢复旧模块，不把历史“已完成”声明直接当成当前事实。

## 0. 任务包元数据

```yaml
taskpack_id: WORK-LAB-FORWARD-RECONCILIATION-2026-08-20
task_namespace: WLR
version: 1.0.0
snapshot_date: 2026-08-20
repository: DTALEX66/WORK-LAB
default_branch: main
audited_remote_head: eafccadb1d7b9eea45a1df4d51369530bdbcc766
audited_tree_source: github-recursive-tree
remote_permission_observed: read-only
status: READY_FOR_LOCAL_SAFE_EXECUTION
product_maturity: CONTROL_PLANE_PROTOTYPE_CONDITIONAL_GO
active_modules:
  - 10-workflow/workflow-assistance
  - 30-observer/work-lab-observer
writer_policy: ONE_INTEGRATION_WRITER_PER_TARGET_TREE
parallel_policy: READ_ONLY_PARALLEL_PLUS_ISOLATED_WORKTREE_CANDIDATES
observer_policy: STRICTLY_READ_ONLY
knowledge_migration: DEFERRED_BY_USER
knowledge_current_authority: WORK-LAB/40-knowledge
model_policy: CLIENT_PROVIDER_MODEL_VERSION_NEUTRAL
publication_policy: EXPLICIT_PER_ACTION_APPROVAL
```

本次只生成任务包，没有修改云端仓库，没有 commit、push、PR、merge、release，也没有修改任何全局 live 配置、外部项目、模型库或系统软件。

