## 6. 前向依赖图

```text
WAVE 0  Truth & Authority Reset
  ↓
WAVE 1  Observer Read-only P0
  ↓
WAVE 2  Canonical Runtime + Project/Execution Truth
  ↓
WAVE 3  Global Configuration Transaction Plane
  ├──────────────┐
  ↓              ↓
WAVE 4 Model     WAVE 5 Single-project Parallel Execution
Efficiency       Acceleration
  └──────┬───────┘
         ↓
WAVE 6 Skills / Plugins / Memory Governance
         ↓
WAVE 7 Temporary Knowledge Governance
         ↓
WAVE 8 Observer Projection + Frontend Rebuild
         ↓
WAVE 9 CI / Canary / Exact-SHA / Final Closure
```

Wave 1 的只读修复是硬门。未通过前不得继续美化 Observer 或增加观测栈组件。Wave 2 的真实 project/execution identity 是 Wave 8 UI 的前置；不允许 UI 先造字段。

